                <i class='far fa-lightbulb-on'></i><span>A contract address hosts a smart contract, which is a set of code stored on the blockchain that runs when predetermined conditions are met. Learn more about addresses in our <a target='_blank' href='https://info.etherscan.com/what-is-an-ethereum-address/'>Knowledge Base</a>.</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <!-- End Page Description -->
    </section>
